Or when you're like passing through the gates of a town, like, oh, you better talk to the

00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:51.140
townspeople here.

00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:57.260
I mean, I think that is going a little too far in the handholdiness, but I do appreciate

