that there is an effect, uh, to letting her die.

00:25:02.260 --> 00:25:03.960
And it's not like a game over.

00:25:04.440 --> 00:25:08.660
I, I, yeah, I think my opinion would, it would probably meet you in the middle there where

00:25:08.660 --> 00:25:11.940
like, I think that saying, Hey, this screen, use that magic.

