Like, I mean, then you're like, okay, that's how I figure out where to go next.

00:25:26.520 --> 00:25:32.160
You still got to talk to the townspeople and interpret their cryptic, uh, words to figure out

00:25:32.160 --> 00:25:50.860
where to go next. And Corona is one of your, uh, many allies that you can have in this game.

00:25:51.060 --> 00:25:57.140
Uh, those are the recruitable party members and they're only accessible during the turn-based

00:25:57.140 --> 00:26:00.520
combat during the action RPG combat.

