saved for not just random screen switches and more for like big impactful battles and

00:27:04.100 --> 00:27:08.220
that the action role-playing probably could have just kept the majority of the game.

00:27:08.220 --> 00:27:15.680
Yeah, this is where my tone's going to shift because they have, they have designed two battle

